<h2 class='greeting'>Hi {{username}}! 🔐</h2>

<p class='message'>
  Two-factor authentication has been successfully enabled for your ChatApp account. Your account is
  now more secure!
</p>

<div class='security-note'>
  <h3>📋 Your Backup Codes</h3>
  <p>Save these backup codes in a safe place. You can use them if you lose access to your
    authenticator app:</p>
  <div
    style='background: #f8fafc; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 1rem 0; font-family: monospace;'
  >
    {{#each backupCodes}}
      <div style='padding: 0.25rem 0;'>{{this}}</div>
    {{/each}}
  </div>
  <p><strong>Note:</strong> Each backup code can only be used once.</p>
</div>

<div class='divider'></div>

<div class='security-note' style='background-color: #f0f9ff; border-left-color: #0ea5e9;'>
  <h3>💡 Security Tips</h3>
  <ul style='color: #0369a1; margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.6;'>
    <li>Keep your backup codes secure</li>
    <li>Use a trusted authenticator app</li>
    <li>Don't share your 2FA codes with anyone</li>
    <li>Update your recovery options regularly</li>
  </ul>
</div>